<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Results ‣ CLEAR: A Comprehensive Linguistic Evaluation of Argument Rewriting by Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Positivity Bias</span></a></li>
